            SAME action as above, so the Contract Dashboards feature is
            reachable from both apps without duplicating any data/config —
            same pattern as "Promoter Analysis" below. A single flat leaf
            (not a container menu) since this feature has only 1 board,
            unlike Promoter Dashboards' 2.

            NAMED WITH THE "(PBI)" SUFFIX, unlike "Promoter Analysis":
            the legacy contract_dashboards module (still installed,
            unrelated to this feature) already owns its OWN "Contract
            Dashboards" container + "Contract Analysis" ks_dashboard_ninja
