            that module's data/contract_dashboard_data.xml). A bare
            "Contract Analysis" leaf here would sit as a sibling of that
            container with an identical-looking nested leaf one level
            in — real, not just theoretical, user confusion (verified live:
            both rendered in the sidebar at the same depth). "(PBI)"
            disambiguates without renaming the legacy board.
        -->
        <menuitem id="menu_my_dashboard_contract_analysis"
                  name="Contract Analysis (PBI)"
